# Keep compact results, decks, logs, parameters, and source/spec snapshots in Git.
# Raw waveforms and their CSV exports remain on disk, including failures.
# See results/README.md and the tracked checksum inventories.
results/**/*.raw
results/**/*.raw.csv
tools/probe-*.raw
